The '''2004 UEFA Cup final''' was an [[association football]] match that took place on 19 May 2004 at [[Ullevi]] in [[Gothenburg]], Sweden, contested between Spanish side [[Valencia CF|Valencia]] and French side [[Olympique de Marseille]]. Valencia won the match 2–0, with goals from [[Vicente Rodríguez|Vicente]] and [[Mista (footballer)|Mista]]. This was the fourth major European trophy won by Valencia.

